(text "No extra serial level converter is needed for normal USB tuning on the genuine module.\nDo not connect RS232 +/- voltage to SER_RX/SER_TX. These are module-side serial nets.\nStepper outputs may already be power outputs on the genuine card: do not use them as ordinary 5 V GPIO.\nThis is a replacement carrier with MS3X-equivalent functions, not a pin-for-pin reproduction of every V3.0 option." (at 15 236 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid b07a49f8-8e13-5127-b1c5-9ec6ac051fd1))
)